  "latest_note": "JSON-object --spec that fails the known-keys/schema gate now errors USAGE_ERROR(2) naming the offending key/issue, instead of silently degrading to details_md prose. Bare non-JSON markdown unaffected. Landing in this worktree's next commit.",
